Package: yea13
Type: Package
Title: Identification of Putative Clusters in Surveillance Data According to Ypma et al. (2013)
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Elias", "Johannes", email = "joheli@gmx.net", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5878-7040")),
    person("Hoehle", "Michael", role = c("ctb"))
    )
Description: Implements the approach described by Ypma et al. (2013)
    <doi:10.1371/journal.pone.0069875> for identifying putative clusters in
    surveillance data. Spatial, type/genetic, and temporal dissimilarities are
    transformed to minimum-spanning-tree hop distances and combined into a
    Ypma dissimilarity, with permutation used to assess unusually tight
    clusters.
